    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      383.12,
      286.68,
      463.28
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following lands which are required for the public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      0.9599039554595947,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      464.71,
      286.68,
      566.72
    ],
    "text": "Description of the Land /Servitude to be acquired: Two allotments of Lands containing in extent of 0.0683 Hectares depicted in preliminary Plan No. Co. 9546 prepared by Superintendent of Surveyor of Colombo situated in Battaramulla village, within the Grama Niladari Division of 492/Sri Subothipura, Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Kaduwela in the Colombo District, Western Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.91920804977417,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      568.44,
      286.66,
      658.64
    ],
    "text": "Lot No. 01 and 02 in P P Co. 9546 01. Lot No. 1 Name of the Land: Polduwa; Present land use: Garden; Owner: State; Previous Owner: Thanthiriwattage Dona Nandani Wajirapani, No. 171, Moratuwa Road, Suwarapola, Pilyandala; Extent: 0.0682 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.32,
      331.28,
      539.65,
      387.44
    ],
    "text": "02. Lot No. 2 Name of the Land: Polduwa; Present land use: Garden; Owner: State; Previous Owner: Thanthiriwattage Dona Nandani Wajirapani, No. 171, Moratuwa Road, Suwarapola, Pilyandala; Extent: 0.0001 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.32,
      388.64,
      539.63,
      525.44
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land are hereby required to appear personally, or agents duly authorized in writing, before me at the Kaduwela Divisional Secretariat on the 12th day of October, 2015 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before 05th day of October, 2015 the nature of them interested in the Land, the particular of their claimed for Compensation for the acquisition of the said land the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.32,
      526.37,
      529.08,
      640.64
    ],
    "text": "W.M. DAYAWATHI, Divisional Secretary, Kaduwela. Divisional Secretariat, Kaduwela, 10th September, 2015.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
